    "detailed_description": "Prepare to lead your favorite school to championship glory as you experience the most realistic college football simulation on the planet. Customize your game world to suit your desires - change everything from the team names and logos all the way to the custom playoff option! Do you wonder what a 16 team playoff would look like? Make it happen with DDS:CF24! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate custom plays and playbooks, get immersed in the game world with the in game media news and magazine options and do what it takes to lead your favorite school to a championship! Link your DDS: College Football 2024 game world to our Draft Day Sports: Pro Football series for seamless integration of the two games for the ultimate football universe!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore all the exciting new features this season like a totally revamped recruiting system which incorporates budgets, distance based recruiting costs, more control in specific recruiting actions. Unlimited packages gives you total control of your depth chart and formations, spring games give you a look at how players might do in the upcoming season and a refreshed interface gives you more info and a brand new way of looking at the game!",
    "about_the_game": "Prepare to lead your favorite school to championship glory as you experience the most realistic college football simulation on the planet. Customize your game world to suit your desires - change everything from the team names and logos all the way to the custom playoff option! Do you wonder what a 16 team playoff would look like? Make it happen with DDS:CF24! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate custom plays and playbooks, get immersed in the game world with the in game media news and magazine options and do what it takes to lead your favorite school to a championship! Link your DDS: College Football 2024 game world to our Draft Day Sports: Pro Football series for seamless integration of the two games for the ultimate football universe!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore all the exciting new features this season like a totally revamped recruiting system which incorporates budgets, distance based recruiting costs, more control in specific recruiting actions. Unlimited packages gives you total control of your depth chart and formations, spring games give you a look at how players might do in the upcoming season and a refreshed interface gives you more info and a brand new way of looking at the game!",
    "short_description": "Draft Day Sports: College Football 2023=4 puts you in the role of head coach for your favorite college football team. Recruit, gameplan and make the right calls on the field to lead your team to the top of the ranks and the college football championship.",
